  "OpenScore (CC0), transcripción de IMSLP #558571 (Gartenlieder op. 3, Bote & Bock): lm-nivel1/fuentes/4_Morgengruss.mscx, compases 1-9, pentagramas de soprano y bajo, cotejados nota a nota con el script tools/mscx.mjs.": "OpenScore (CC0), transcription of IMSLP #558571 (Gartenlieder op. 3, Bote & Bock): lm-nivel1/fuentes/4_Morgengruss.mscx, bars 1-9, soprano and bass staves, checked note by note with the script tools/mscx.mjs.",
