  "Re, mi, fa, sol, la: una 5.ª.": "D, E, F, G, A: a 5th.",
  "Re-fa-la y acaba en re: re menor.": "D-F-A and it ends on D: D minor.",
  "Re-mi-fa-sol-la-si♭-do (y re): las notas de fa mayor empezando en re.": "D-E-F-G-A-B♭-C (and D): the notes of F major starting on D.",
  "Reconoce los conceptos en preguntas de elegir.": "Recognises the concepts in multiple-choice questions.",
  "Reconocer de oído y cantar desde do la 3.ª, la 5.ª y la 8.ª, y después todos los intervalos de 2.ª a 8.ª.": "Recognise by ear and sing from C the 3rd, the 5th and the 8th, and then all intervals from the 2nd to the 8th.",
  "Reconocer las tonalidades del nivel por su armadura y por su nota final, leyendo y de oído.": "Recognise the keys of the level by their key signature and by their final note, both by reading and by ear.",
  "Reconocer re menor como relativa de fa mayor (mismas notas, descansa en re) y distinguirlas de oído.": "Recognise D minor as the relative minor of F major (same notes, resting on D) and tell them apart by ear.",
  "Reconocimiento auditivo y escritura de ritmos y melodías; número de escuchas.": "Aural recognition and writing of rhythms and melodies; number of listenings.",
  "Recordar las figuras, los compases y las notas del nivel 1 leyendo y cantando sin apoyo.": "To remember the note values, time signatures and notes from Level 1 by reading and singing without support.",
  "Redobles de semicorcheas con manos alternas (D-I-D-I) y el galope D-DI; xilófono: «Lluvia y sol».": "Sixteenth-note rolls with alternating hands (R-L-R-L) and the gallop R-RL; xylophone: “Rain and Sun”.",
  "Reducción para canto y piano de la ópera (San Petersburgo: Bessel, ca. 1901, plancha 4849, dominio público), acto III, cuadro 1, n.º 156 «Vivace, negra = 144», 2/4: IMSLP #29126 (https://imslp.org/wiki/The_Tale_of_Tsar_Saltan_(Rimsky-Korsakov,_Nikolay)). Compases 1-4 cotejados nota a nota con el escaneo y con la transcripción CC0 de esa edición de James Brigham (2017, MusicXML, IMSLP #482362).": "Vocal score reduction of the opera (St Petersburg: Bessel, c. 1901, plate 4849, public domain), act III, scene 1, no. 156 “Vivace, quarter note = 144”, 2/4: IMSLP #29126 (https://imslp.org/wiki/The_Tale_of_Tsar_Saltan_(Rimsky-Korsakov,_Nikolay)). Bars 1-4 checked note by note against the scan and against the CC0 transcription of that edition by James Brigham (2017, MusicXML, IMSLP #482362).",
  "Ree": "D",
  "Refuerzo: lm2-puntillo, lm2-semicorcheas, lm2-clave-fa, lm2-seis-por-ocho, lm2-intervalos, lm2-alteraciones, lm2-armaduras, lm2-repaso (páginas nuevas del Libro).": "Reinforcement: lm2-puntillo, lm2-semicorcheas, lm2-clave-fa, lm2-seis-por-ocho, lm2-intervalos, lm2-alteraciones, lm2-armaduras, lm2-repaso (new pages in the Book).",
