  "Una canción tiene 10 compases escritos: los compases 1-6 se repiten; la casilla 1 (compases 7-8) se toca la 1.ª vez y la casilla 2 (compases 9-10), la 2.ª. ¿Cuántos compases suenan en total?": "A song has 10 written bars: bars 1–6 are repeated; 1st ending (bars 7–8) is played the 1st time and 2nd ending (bars 9–10) the 2nd time. How many bars are heard in total?",
